// Force monolithic genproto to a version after the googleapis/rpc split,
// preventing ambiguous import with google.golang.org/genproto/googleapis/rpc.
replace google.golang.org/genproto v0.0.0-20200825200019-8632dd797987 => google.golang.org/genproto v0.0.0-20260319201613-d00831a3d3e7
